  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge Phase II Programme(Cte d&apos;Ivoire): Expanding Basic Education Access for Marginalized Groups through Non-formal Education in Northern and Southe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance access to basic education for out-of-school children and illiterate adults in three northern and southern districts of Cote d&apos;Ivoire. By supporting non-formal education, it seeks to improve literacy, quality of life, and poverty reduction, contributing to SDG 4.  
  In collaboration with the Cote d&apos;Ivoire National Commission for UNESCO, the project will help improve Cote d&apos;Ivoire&apos;s non-formal education policies and establish Classe Passerelle and Literacy Classes.</narrative>
  </description>
